{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --glass:#ffffff22;\\n      --glass-2:#ffffff18;\\n      --accent:#6aa0ff;\\n      --muted:#657080;\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --max-width:920px;\\n      color-scheme: light;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f6fbff 0%,#eef6ff 40%,#f7fbff 100%);}\\n    body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:48px 20px;}\\n    .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-width);position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;}\\n    /* subtle pattern using external SVG (assets/img/pattern.svg) */\\n    .hero{background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg'),linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffffbb,#ffffff88);background-size:420px,cover;padding:34px;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(22,36,50,0.08);backdrop-filter:blur(8px) saturate(120%);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}\\n    header.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px;}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}\\n    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9be18a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(106,160,255,0.15);}\\n    nav a{color:#102133;text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;opacity:0.9;}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;}\\n    .content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;align-items:start;}\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;color:#0c2340;}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 16px 0;color:var(--muted);}\\n    .method-card{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}\\n    label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;color:#163047;font-size:13px;}\\n    select,input,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(16,32,50,0.07);background:white;font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box;}\\n    textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical;}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7fd6ff);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer;}\\n    .secondary{background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}\\n    details{margin-top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}\\n    summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;color:#12334a;}\\n    .crisis{margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border-left:4px solid #ffb199;background:#fff4f0;color:#5a2b1f;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.content{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand{gap:10px;}nav{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='hero'>\\n      <header class='nav'>\\n        <div class='brand'>\\n          <div class='logo'>T</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style='font-weight:700;color:#072033'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <nav aria-label='Primary'>\\n          <a href='index.html'>Connect</a>\\n          <a href='about.html'>Who I Am</a>\\n          <a href='specialties.html'>Services</a>\\n          <a href='approach.html'>Way</a>\\n          <a href='fees.html'>Costs</a>\\n          <a href='faq.html'>FAQ</a>\\n          <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n          <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n        </nav>\\n      </header>\\n      <div class='content'>\\n        <main class='panel' aria-labelledby='contact-heading'>\\n          <h1 id='contact-heading'>Connect and next steps</h1>\\n          <p class='lead'>If you'd like to reach out, this page offers two simple routes: a quick note here, or a tailored next step suggested by the mood-to-method selector. I aim to match your current need to a supportive way of working.</p>\\n\\n          <section class='method-card' aria-labelledby='method-title'>\\n            <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>\\n              <div>\\n                <div id='method-title' style='font-weight:800;color:#082436'>A gentle starting suggestion</div>\\n                <div id='method-sub' style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Choose how you are feeling and I will suggest a way we might work together now.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Prefer phone? <br><strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n              <label for='mood'>How are you right now?</label>\\n              <select id='mood' aria-describedby='method-sub'>\\n                <option value='curious'>Curious — exploring if therapy fits</option>\\n                <option value='overwhelmed'>Overwhelmed — need short-term relief</option>\\n                <option value='stuck'>Stuck — working through a persistent problem</option>\\n                <option value='transition'>Transitioning — life changes to navigate</option>\\n                <option value='maintaining'>Maintaining — steady support to stay on track</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div id='method-info' style='margin-top:12px'>\\n              <p style='margin:0;color:var(--muted)'>Suggested approach appears here when you choose an item above. It will also refresh the primary contact action to reflect that suggestion.</p>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style='margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'>\\n              <a id='primary-cta' class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' data-default='{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n              <button id='email-send' class='secondary' aria-label='Send a message by email'>Send a message</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='meta'>Responses aim to arrive within a few business days. If you prefer, include your availability and how you prefer to connect in the message below.</div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          <form id='contact-form' class='panel' style='margin-top:16px' onsubmit='return false'>\\n            <label for='name'>Your name</label>\\n            <input id='name' name='name' placeholder='First and last name'>\\n            <label for='email'>Email</label>\\n            <input id='email' name='email' placeholder='you@example.com'>\\n            <label for='message'>A brief note</label>\\n            <textarea id='message' name='message' placeholder='I am reaching out because...'></textarea>\\n            <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>\\n              <button id='send-mail' class='cta' type='button'>Send via email</button>\\n              <button id='reset' class='secondary' type='button'>Clear</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='meta' style='margin-top:12px'>You can also reach me at <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a> or <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n          <details open style='margin-top:16px'>\\n            <summary>Session boundaries</summary>\\n            <div style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px'>\\n              I aim to be clear about what to expect when we work together. Sessions begin and end at the agreed time. If you need to cancel, I ask for as much notice as possible so the time can be offered to others. Payment policies and appointment length are discussed when we set up sessions.\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='crisis' role='note'>If you are in immediate danger, please call emergency services (for example, 911 in the United States) or go to your nearest emergency department. If you are thinking about harming yourself, contact local crisis services or your country’s appropriate helpline.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details style='margin-top:12px'>\\n            <summary>Confidentiality & scope</summary>\\n            <div style='margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px'>\\n              Therapy conversations are confidential within ethical and legal limits. Exceptions include imminent risk of harm to you or others, suspected abuse of a child or vulnerable person, or situations where a lawful court order requires disclosure. If you have questions about how I handle records or what I would share, we can review that before we begin.\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='crisis' role='note'>If there is an urgent safety concern, reach out to emergency services or your local crisis line. If you’re unsure what to do, contacting your local health services is a safe step.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n        </main>\\n\\n        <aside class='panel' aria-labelledby='side-heading'>\\n          <h3 id='side-heading' style='margin-top:0'>Quick reference</h3>\\n          <div style='font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)'>\\n            <strong>Location</strong><br>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}<br><br>\\n            <strong>Email</strong><br><a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a><br><br>\\n            <strong>Phone</strong><br><a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:18px'>\\n            <h4 style='margin:0 0 6px 0'>How I frame ongoing support</h4>\\n            <p style='margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px'>Rather than packages with fixed labels, I offer flexible ongoing membership and focused sequences for a period you and I agree on. We can discuss timing and frequency during first contact.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:18px'>\\n            <h4 style='margin:0 0 6px 0'>Accessibility</h4>\\n            <p style='margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px'>If there are accommodations that would help you engage (captioning, timing adjustments, or other supports), let me know in your initial message.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    (function(){\\n      const mood = document.getElementById('mood');\\n      const info = document.getElementById('method-info');\\n      const title = document.getElementById('method-title');\\n      const cta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');\\n      const emailBtn = document.getElementById('email-send');\\n      const sendMail = document.getElementById('send-mail');\\n      const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\\n\\n      const mapping = {\\n        curious:{label:'Intro Consultation',desc:'A short 30–45 minute conversation to see if my approach feels like a good fit and to clarify next steps. Useful if you are exploring therapy for the first time or comparing options.'},\\n        overwhelmed:{label:'Short Check-in',desc:'A focused session designed to create immediate breathing room and practical next steps when things feel like too much. Helps stabilize day-to-day functioning without committing to a long course.'},\\n        stuck:{label:'Guided Series',desc:'A short sequence of focused sessions to work through a recurring problem with measurable practice-based steps between meetings.'},\\n        transition:{label:'Transition Support',desc:'A pacing of sessions tailored to help you navigate change and practical decisions, with space for reflection and planning.'},\\n        maintaining:{label:'Ongoing Support',desc:'Regular sessions at an interval that helps you maintain forward movement and manage recurring stressors without needing frequent enrollment changes.'}\\n      };\\n\\n      function refresh(){\\n        const key = mood.value;\\n        const entry = mapping[key] || mapping.curious;\\n        title.textContent = entry.label;\\n        info.innerHTML = '<p style=\\'margin:0;color:var(--muted)\\'>'+entry.desc+'</p>';\\n        // update CTA text but preserve original fallback if unavailable\\n        const defaultLabel = cta.getAttribute('data-default') || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';\\n        cta.textContent = entry.label + ' — ' + defaultLabel;\\n        // ensure href points to primary URL but include fragment for context\\n        const base = cta.getAttribute('href') || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';\\n        cta.setAttribute('href', base + (base.includes('#')? '' : '#') + 'contact-' + key);\\n      }\\n\\n      mood.addEventListener('change', refresh);\\n      refresh();\\n\\n      emailBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\\n        // open default mail client with minimal info to preserve privacy\\n        const subject = encodeURIComponent('Inquiry — '+(document.getElementById('name').value||'') );\\n        const body = encodeURIComponent('\\n\\nMessage initiated from contact form. Please include your availability, preferred contact method, and a brief note.');\\n        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;\\n      });\\n\\n      sendMail.addEventListener('click', function(){\\n        const n = document.getElementById('name').value || '';\\n        const e = document.getElementById('email').value || '';\\n        const m = document.getElementById('message').value || '';\\n        const subject = encodeURIComponent('Website inquiry from '+(n||'visitor'));\n        const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+n+'\\nEmail: '+e+'\\n\\nMessage:\\n'+m+'\\n\\nI am reaching out from the contact page.');\\n        // Use mailto for local handling; no external submission\\n        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;\\n      });\\n\\n      resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\\n        document.getElementById('name').value='';\\n        document.getElementById('email').value='';\\n        document.getElementById('message').value='';\\n      });\\n\\n    })();\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and how to use it\\n\\nFiles in this bundle chunk:\\n- contact.html: The contact page with a Mood-to-Method selector, contact form (mailto-based), session boundaries and confidentiality accordions, and a crisis footer. Designed for a glass-morphism aesthetic and references a local SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg.\\n\\nHow Mood-to-Method works\\n- The select control labeled 'How are you right now?' maps five states to suggested ways of working: Intro Consultation, Short Check-in, Guided Series, Transition Support, and Ongoing Support.\\n- When the user changes the selection the UI updates: the method title, a short description, and the primary CTA text. The primary CTA retains its original link ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) but appends a fragment to indicate the chosen mood.\\n- The CTA label is generated as: [Suggested approach] — [{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}] so the user sees both the suggestion and the standard action phrase.\\n\\nForm behavior and privacy note\\n- The contact form does not submit to a server. 'Send via email' constructs a mailto: link to {{EMAIL}} with the entered data. This keeps messages on the user’s device and avoids client-side submission to unknown endpoints.\\n- The page includes clear notes about confidentiality, limits of confidentiality, and a respectful crisis footer advising callers to contact emergency services or local crisis lines when needed. No medical guarantees or promises are made.\\n\\nPlaceholders to provide during deployment\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nAccessibility and testing\\n- The page uses semantic elements (details/summary, form inputs) and labels.\\n- Test the mailto behavior on your device to ensure it opens the preferred mail client.\\n- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for the decorative background; include a unique SVG at that path in your project for the pattern to appear.\\n\\nNotes for clinicians and compliance\\n- The copy intentionally avoids medical claims and contains a clear explanation of confidentiality limits and how to access crisis services.\\n- If you need to adapt crisis contact details to your country or organization, edit the crisis copy in contact.html.\\n\\nCustomization tips\\n- To change the mood options or mapping, edit the mapping object in the inline script in contact.html (the keys: curious, overwhelmed, stuck, transition, maintaining).\\n- To change visual theming, modify CSS variables at the top of the style block.\\n\\nIf you need an additional file (for example assets/img/pattern.svg) included in this chunk, request the next chunk to add it."}
BUNDLE_END
